[38;2;124;124;124mThe question is: does non-separability of $A$ imply that every representation is[0m[38;2;124;124;124minfinite-dimensional?[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mFirst, let me think about whether this is true or false.[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mConsider the commutative case. If $A = C_0(X)$ for some locally compact [0m
