[38;2;124;124;124mA representation of $C_0(X)$ corresponds to a spectral measure on $X$. The one-[0m
[38;2;124;124;124mdimensional representations (characters) correspond to point evaluations $[0m
[38;2;124;124;124m\delta_x: f \mapsto f(x)$ for $x \in X$.[0m

